OL,3,GNEWSANear 3,000-year-old gold treasure
OL,4,Agoes on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FBronze age gold bracelets officially
OL,7,Fclassed as treasure have gone on
OL,8,Fdisplay to the public for the first
OL,9,Ftime after being found by a metal
OL,10,Fdetectorist.
OL,12,FThe hoard of three bracelets from near
OL,13,FMalmesbury, in Wiltshire, two of which
OL,14,Fhave been rolled up and flattened, date
OL,15,Fto the late bronze age.
OL,17,FThey have been acquired by Athelstan
OL,18,FMuseum in Malmesbury, which has them on
OL,19,Fdisplay until February when they will
OL,20,Fbe sent for conservation work.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
