OL,3,GNEWSANear 3,000-year-old gold treasure
OL,4,Agoes on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal historian and museum trustee Tony
OL,7,FMcAleavy said: "Not only are they
OL,8,Fbeautiful objects, but they are
OL,9,Fimportant because they shed light on
OL,10,Flife in the Malmesbury area around
OL,11,F3,000 years ago."
